OL,3,GNEWSARevolut outage hits 'multiple
OL,4,Aservices' as thousands of users report
OL,5,Aapp issues
OL,6,
OL,7,FRevolut has been hit by an outage which
OL,8,Fit says is impacting "multiple
OL,9,Fservices", as thousands of customers
OL,10,Freport problems.
OL,12,FUsers of the British bank have flagged
OL,13,Fbeing unable to make some payments or
OL,14,Faccess funds via its app on Tuesday
OL,15,Fmorning.
OL,17,FPlatform outage monitor Downdetector
OL,18,Fhad seen more than 1,500 user reports
OL,19,Fof issues with Revolut services shortly
OL,20,Fafter 08:00 BST.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,418,410,260,120,0,100
