OL,3,GNEWSARevolut outage hits 'multiple
OL,4,Aservices' as thousands of users report
OL,5,Aapp issues
OL,6,
OL,7,F"We are currently experiencing a
OL,8,Fservice disruption affecting multiple
OL,9,Fservices," a Revolut spokesperson told
OL,10,Fthe BBC - adding "we can confirm that
OL,11,Fall our customers' money and data are
OL,12,Fsafe."
